        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Expanding publicly funded preschool for disadvantaged children requires evidence beyond Perry's economic returns.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "This policy judgment calls for evidence about the programs and populations proposed for expansion. It does not deny the positive returns estimated for Perry itself.",
