        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Heckman and colleagues (2010), Table 7, report SE 2.2 for the pooled sample, using the $13,000 murder valuation and $0.50 tax-financing welfare loss per tax dollar. This scenario omits benefits after age 40 but still uses imputation and economic valuation.",
